      "userId": "guest_anonymous",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're caught between wanting to be productive and needing to recharge. When you're feeling drained, the best \"useful\" thing you can do is often something that lowers your mental load rather than adding to it.\n\nWould you prefer to do something low-effort that feels like a win, like tidying up a small corner of your space, or would you rather take a guilt-free break to actually rest so you can tackle more later?",
