      "content": "I am a text-based AI, so I can't directly generate image files like JPEGs or PNGs. However, I can help you write highly detailed, creative prompts that you can plug into tools like Midjourney, DALL-E, or Stable Diffusion to get exactly the result you’re looking for.\n\nIf you tell me what you have in mind, I can help you refine the description, lighting, style, and composition to make sure the output is high-quality. What kind of image were you thinking of creating?",
